      "path": "docs/cache-policy.md",
      "markdown": "---\ntitle: Cache freshness policy\nstatus: accepted\n---\n\n# Cache freshness policy\n\nAll data caches expire after 60 minutes to prevent stale results.\nRead the [thumbnail exception](thumbnail-exception.md) before applying this policy.\n",
      "sha256": "c447260f929fe6b370a0fe9157d3e19ec0be15651616e09e42bccdde18c8b917"
    },
    {
      "path": "docs/thumbnail-exception.md",
      "markdown": "---\ntitle: Content-addressed thumbnail exception\nstatus: accepted\n---\n\n# Content-addressed thumbnail exception\n\nThis amends the [cache freshness policy](cache-policy.md) only for thumbnail caches keyed by the immutable content SHA-256.\nThose thumbnail caches expire after 1440 minutes because changed content always has a new key.\nAll other caches, including dynamic catalogue API responses, still expire after 60 minutes.\nA URL-keyed thumbnail cache does not qualify for this exception.\n",
      "sha256": "e24f858ac4e57b7171fec30901bdfd139d519a0dc147edf25ac3470d21b9d293"
    }
  ],
